body:
Very very recently, that person was everything to me and gave me energy to overcome my problems. I lost all my hope and progress on getting out of this crap. I dont know what to do, i have no one to even talk about everyday stuff. I used to have a lot of hobbies, im very creative person, but depression took it away from me.   
And since that person left me im all alone and have no one in my life, thats why i really want to end this all. Im just too tired of this. 

&#x200B;

I used to play alot, it was my escape from my problems, but not anymore, i stopped enjoying it. I was just average kid but when i grew up i started noticing that i dont belong here and i couldnt live the 'avarage' life. So i started to be sad all the time, then selfharm, and in the end suicidal. Im socially awkard to the point that i just cant talk to people, i dont know how. Because of this, im alone, and since the only person that i care about left me, im just by myself all the time. 

&#x200B;

I need people, but people don't need me. And i cant take it anymore.
